{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://github.com/shoedog/prism/contracts/observations.schema.json",
  "title": "Runtime observations (v1)",
  "description": "Produced by the runtime harness after running a test command with faults injected at instrumentation targets. Default granularity: one observation per (target, fault, test) triple actually attempted (the same site is commonly reached by several tests, and which test reached it is evidence the classifier uses); a harness may collapse to (target, fault) pairs when asked (CR-5). Plus one observation per target with reached=false when the site never executed (coverage gap). OTel-compatible where possible: each observation may carry trace/span ids. v1.1 (2026-09-04, additive; schema_version stays \"1\"): run.classification_rules_version (CR-8), run.plan_id, observation.resolution (CR-7), not_reached_reason += fault_unavailable (a fault whose binding could not be prepared: `fault` IS present and `observed` is absent), side-effect events gain t_ms.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "schema_version",
    "run",
    "observations"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "const": "1"
    },
    "run": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "started_at",
        "language",
        "harness_version",
        "targets_sha256"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "started_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "finished_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "language": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "harness_version": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "targets_sha256": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "description": "sha256 of the targets JSON file consumed."
        },
        "test_command": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "repo_sha": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "mechanism": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Injection mechanism used. Known values: python.attr_patch (namespace-resolved attribute patching scoped by caller frame; harness v0), python.import_hook, node.loader_hook, go.shim, java.bytebuddy, toxiproxy. Unknown values are allowed but must be documented by the producer (CR-4).",
          "examples": [
            "python.attr_patch",
            "node.loader_hook",
            "toxiproxy"
          ]
        },
        "catalog_sha256": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "description": "sha256 of the fault catalog file that supplied retryable/fatal semantics (CR-3)."
        },
        "catalog_version": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Catalog's own version string (CR-3)."
        },
        "python_version": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Interpreter version, e.g. 3.12.4; injection behaviour depends on CPython line-number reporting (CR-6)."
        },
        "platform": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "platform.platform() or equivalent (CR-6)."
        },
        "classification_rules_version": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "description": "Version of the ordered outcome-classification rule set (runtime-harness spec \u00a76.3) that produced every observed.outcome in this document (CR-8). A port must reproduce the same version's outputs on the conformance fixtures."
        },
        "plan_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "description": "plan.schema.json plan_id of the experiment set this run executed."
        }
      }
    },
    "observations": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/observation"
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "observation": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "target_id",
        "site",
        "reached"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "target_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
        },
        "site": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "file",
            "line"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "file": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "line": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "symbol": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "reached": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "false \u21d2 the site never executed under the test command; nothing else is populated. This is a finding in its own right (untested error path)."
        },
        "not_reached_reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "never_executed",
            "callee_unresolved",
            "no_applicable_fault",
            "ambiguous_receiver",
            "patch_shadowed",
            "run_timeout",
            "plugin_error",
            "fault_unavailable",
            "no_dependency_hint"
          ],
          "description": "Why the site produced no fault observation; meaningful only when reached == false (CR-2). never_executed: the test command never ran the site; callee_unresolved: dependency_hint/site text could not be bound to a patchable object; no_applicable_fault: no catalog entry matched; ambiguous_receiver: more than one binding candidate; patch_shadowed: the callee was rebound locally before the site; run_timeout: the run hit --timeout-s; plugin_error: harness-internal failure (see log_excerpt). `fault_unavailable`: the injector could not prepare the fault's binding (no exception candidate importable/constructible, builder cannot serve the resolved root) \u2014 `fault` is present so the consumer knows which fault was undeliverable, `reached` is false and `observed` is absent."
        },
        "fault": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "catalog_id",
            "kind",
            "name"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "catalog_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Fault catalog entry id, e.g. http.timeout, db.connection_lost."
            },
            "kind": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "http",
                "db",
                "queue",
                "filesystem",
                "clock",
                "process",
                "network",
                "cache"
              ]
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "params": {
              "type": "object"
            },
            "retryable": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "Catalog's documented semantics: is this fault transient/retryable?"
            },
            "fatal": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "Catalog's documented semantics: must this fault propagate (never be swallowed)?"
            }
          }
        },
        "observed": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "outcome",
            "duration_ms"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "outcome": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "propagated",
                "swallowed",
                "retried_then_succeeded",
                "retried_then_failed",
                "fallback_returned",
                "partial_returned",
                "crashed",
                "hung",
                "unknown"
              ]
            },
            "exception": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "message": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "propagated_to": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Function name where it was last observed (caught or test boundary)."
                }
              }
            },
            "retries": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "count": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "backoff_ms": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "number"
                  }
                },
                "bounded": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                }
              }
            },
            "return_value_summary": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Type + short repr of the value returned from the enclosing function, if it returned."
            },
            "duration_ms": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "timeout_configured_ms": {
              "type": [
                "number",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "side_effects": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "kind"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "kind": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "write",
                      "emit",
                      "log",
                      "network",
                      "delete",
                      "other"
                    ]
                  },
                  "detail": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "after_fault": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "t_ms": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Monotonic ms since probe entry (v1.1; projected unchanged from the fragment event)."
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "resources": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "open_fds_delta": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "threads_delta": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "locks_held_after": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "listeners_delta": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              }
            },
            "test": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "passed",
                    "failed",
                    "error",
                    "skipped"
                  ]
                },
                "assertion_message": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "trace_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "span_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "log_excerpt": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 4000
        },
        "resolution": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "status"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "resolved",
                "unresolved"
              ]
            },
            "owner_kind": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "owner": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "attr": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "predicted_owner_kind": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "agreed": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "reason": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 1000
            }
          },
          "description": "Where the patch actually landed (CR-7; runtime fact from the injector, see fragment.schema.json `resolution`)."
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
